msgid ""
"Currently this example only works on OSX and Windows. Refer to the `notes"
" of uv_fs_event_start`_ function."
msgstr ""
"目前这个示例只能在 OSX 和 Windows 上工作。请参阅 `notes of "
"uv_fs_event_start`_ 函数。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:298
msgid "The file change notification is started using ``uv_fs_event_init()``:"
msgstr "文件变更通知使用 ``uv_fs_event_init()`` 启动："

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:300
msgid "onchange/main.c - The setup"
msgstr "onchange/main.c - 设置"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:307
msgid ""
"The third argument is the actual file or directory to monitor. The last "
"argument, ``flags``, can be:"
msgstr ""
"第三个参数是要监视的实际文件或目录。最后一个参数 ``flags`` 的取值可以是："

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:321
msgid ""
"``UV_FS_EVENT_WATCH_ENTRY`` and ``UV_FS_EVENT_STAT`` don't do anything "
"(yet). ``UV_FS_EVENT_RECURSIVE`` will start watching subdirectories as "
"well on supported platforms."
msgstr ""
"``UV_FS_EVENT_WATCH_ENTRY`` 和 ``UV_FS_EVENT_STAT`` 目前尚无任何作用。在支"
"持的平台上，``UV_FS_EVENT_RECURSIVE`` 还会同时开始监视子目录。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:325
msgid "The callback will receive the following arguments:"
msgstr "回调将接收以下参数："

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:327
msgid ""
"``uv_fs_event_t *handle`` - The handle. The ``path`` field of the handle "
"is the file on which the watch was set."
msgstr ""
"``uv_fs_event_t *handle`` - 句柄。句柄的 ``path`` 字段即设置了监视的文件。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:329
msgid ""
"``const char *filename`` - If a directory is being monitored, this is the"
" file which was changed. Only non-``null`` on Linux and Windows. May be "
"``null`` even on those platforms."
msgstr ""
"``const char *filename`` - 如果监视的是目录，此参数是被更改的文件。仅在 "
"Linux 和 Windows 上为非 ``null``。即使在这些平台上，它也可能为 ``null``。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:332
msgid ""
"``int events`` - one of ``UV_RENAME`` or ``UV_CHANGE``, or a bitwise OR "
"of both."
msgstr ""
"``int events`` - ``UV_RENAME`` 或 ``UV_CHANGE`` 之一，或两者的按位或。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:334
msgid ""
"``int status`` - If ``status < 0``, there is an :ref:`libuv error<libuv-"
"error-handling>`."
msgstr ""
"``int status`` - 如果 ``status < 0``，则存在 :ref:`libuv error<libuv-"
"error-handling>`。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:336
msgid ""
"In our example we simply print the arguments and run the command using "
"``system()``."
msgstr ""
"在我们的示例中，我们只是打印这些参数，并使用 ``system()`` 运行命令。"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:339
msgid "onchange/main.c - file change notification callback"
msgstr "onchange/main.c - 文件变更通知回调"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:347
msgid ""
"inotify on Linux, FSEvents on Darwin, kqueue on BSDs, "
"ReadDirectoryChangesW on Windows, event ports on Solaris, unsupported on "
"Cygwin"
msgstr ""
"Linux 上是 inotify，Darwin 上是 FSEvents，各 BSD 上是 kqueue，Windows 上是 "
"ReadDirectoryChangesW，Solaris 上是 event ports，Cygwin 上不受支持"

#: ../../src/guide/filesystem.rst:349
msgid "see :ref:`pipes`"
msgstr "参见 :ref:`pipes`"

